message: >-
  If you use ZPE-Neuro, cite this repository record.
type: software
title: "ZPE-Neuro: Deterministic Spike-Event Extraction for Extracellular Neuroscience Pipelines"
authors:
  - name: "Zer0pa (Pty) Ltd"
    email: architects@zer0pa.ai
repository-code: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Neuro
url: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Neuro
license: LicenseRef-Zer0pa-SAL-7.0
abstract: >-
  ZPE-Neuro provides deterministic spike-event extraction for extracellular
  neuroscience pipelines. It is scoped to bounded public-dataset reproducibility,
  replay, and audit lineage for the current DANDI and IBL proof surface.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - extracellular recording
  - spike-event encoding
  - nwb
  - dandi
  - ibl
